DBA: the database (dbm-style) abstraction layer, with the cdb,
inifile and flatfile handlers.

The module dba of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/dba.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/dba.
